  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:36px\">Огромный </span><span style=\"color:#808080;font-size:36px\">2-летний</span><span style=\"font-size:36px\"> город </span><span style=\"color:#008000;font-size:36px\"><strong>Minecraft</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:36px\">.</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">На этой карте я и несколько друзей построили MiaoMiaoCity — </span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\">город</span><span style=\"font-size:24px\"> с </span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\">Домами</span><span style=\"font-size:24px\">, </span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\">Магазинами</span><span style=\"font-size:24px\">, </span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\">Дорогами</span><span style=\"font-size:24px\">, </span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\">Ресторанами</span><span style=\"font-size:24px\"> ...</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Строители: xX_Leonite22_Xx (я), XxGufo74xX, XxGufetta74xX, The_Spartan_exe, Mattypic2.</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:36px;color:#f60\"><strong>Важно!</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#800000\"><strong>Для этой карты требуются некоторые моды!</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#800000\"><strong>список модов:&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#800000\"><strong>[1.16.5]+SecurityCraft+v1.8.22.2:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/security-craft/download/3361074\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/security-craft/download/3361074</a></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#800000\"><strong>appleskin-forge-mc1.16.x-2.0.0:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/appleskin/download/3358019\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/appleskin/download/3358019</a></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#800000\"><strong>BiomesOPlenty-1.16.5-13.1.0.480-universal:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty/download/3381046\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty/download/3381046</a></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#800000\"><strong>cfm-7.0.0pre22-1.16.3:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mrcrayfish-furniture-mod/download/3346467\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mrcrayfish-furniture-mod/download/3346467</a></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#800000\"><strong>Chisel-MC1.16.5-2.0.1-alpha.4:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chisel/download/3376782\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chisel/download/3376782</a></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#800000\"><strong>chiselsandbits-0.3.4-RELEASE:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chisels-bits/download/3234842\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chisels-bits/download/3234842</a></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#800000\"><strong>CookingForBlockheads_1.16.5-9.3.3:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cooking-for-blockheads/download/3368022\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cooking-for-blockheads/download/3368022</a></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#800000\"><strong>CTM-MC1.16.1-1.1.2.6:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ctm/download/3137659\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ctm/download/3137659</a></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#800000\"><strong>glasscutter-1.1.1-1.16.5:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/